FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Lumberg 0105 05: the model 0105 05  3D(2019.08.20) with its contacts cut off at the underside of the insulating body, and below it the solder pins of poles 1 to 5 and the ground pins of the model of the 0105 08-1 (LN-0507-8_1_), which are where the data sheet has them. Coloured: plastic dark grey, contacts and pins metal'),'2;1');
